# GMS asks for a shield or a dagger scabbard in the off hand and grants DEF,
# avoidability, attack and damage reduction for it. Avoidability has nowhere to
# land -- nothing in this game avoids anything.
#
# The rest is on GMS's own figures: DEF and the damage taken both 11% and 6% a
# level, and attack ending at its +20. All of it waits on the off hand. The DEF
# is worth nothing and is here for the figure -- see SkillEffect::def_pct.
name: "Shield Mastery"
skill_order: 8
description:
  "What you carry in your off hand turns blows aside. Increases Defense and "
  "Attack Power, and decreases damage taken. Needs something in the secondary "
  "slot."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BANDIT
max_level: 10
requires_secondary: true
base {
  damage_taken_pct: 0.06
  def_pct: 0.11
  attack: 2
}
per_level {
  damage_taken_pct: 0.06
  def_pct: 0.11
  attack: 2
}
